{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QVTrrQewG878pE2z7cpDPT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Policy Amendments — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## AMD-1 Historic purchasing limit\n4\tBefore July 1, 2025, routine purchases of **$2,000 or less** required manager approval; routine purchases **above $2,000** required both manager and finance approval.\n5\t\n6\t## AMD-2 Current purchasing limit\n7\tEffective **July 1, 2025**, the routine threshold increased to **$2,500**. The current limit does **not** apply retroactively.\n8\t\n9\t## AMD-3 Scope\n10\tThe amendment changes only the routine purchasing threshold, not the Emergency, Vendor, or Travel Policies.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9035fd3b-1958-4da2-b865-86832a95d460","uuid":"b8adc105-e216-4f76-8b26-968e10538c51","timestamp":"2026-10-13T21:44:05.493Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\mmazu\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\cp14-seven-sessions-20261013\\C_SEVEN_01\\Q3\\05-policy-amendments.md","content":"# Policy Amendments — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## AMD-1 Historic purchasing limit\nBefore July 1, 2025, routine purchases of **$2,000 or less** required manager approval; routine purchases **above $2,000** required both manager and finance approval.\n\n## AMD-2 Current purchasing limit\nEffective **July 1, 2025**, the routine threshold increased to **$2,500**. The current limit does **not** apply retroactively.\n\n## AMD-3 Scope\nThe amendment changes only the routine purchasing threshold, not the Emergency, Vendor, or Travel Policies.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
